{"pull": {"id": "number:19269", "number": 19269, "title": "KAFKA-18067: Add a flag to disable producer reset during active task creator shutting down", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2025-03-23T15:00:31Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-03T21:13:22Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-03T21:13:22Z", "user": {"login": "frankvicky", "id": 51072200, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjUxMDcyMjAw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51072200?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky", "html_url": "https://github.com/frankvicky", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/frankvicky/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "JIRA: KAFKA-18067\r\n\r\nFix producer client double-closing issue in Kafka Streams. \r\nDuring StreamThread shutdown, TaskManager closes first, which closes the producer client. Later, calling `unsubscribe` on the main consumer may trigger the `onPartitionsLost` callback, attempting to reset StreamsProducer when EOS is enabled. This causes an already closed producer to be closed twice while the newly created producer is never closed.\r\n\r\nIn detail:\r\nThis patch adds a flag to control the producer reset and has a new method to change this flag, which is only invoked in `ActiveTaskCreator#close`.\r\nThis would guarantee that the disable reset producer will only occur when StreamThread shuts down.\r\n", "labels": [{"id": 820747028, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWw4MjA3NDcwMjg=", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/streams", "name": "streams", "color": "63edea", "default": false, "description": null, "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7522931565, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwGbTbQ", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/ci-approved", "name": "ci-approved", "color": "ffffff", "default": false, "description": "", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 7559660738, "node_id": "LA_kwDOACG9q88AAAABwpdEwg", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/apache/kafka/labels/small", "name": "small", "color": "FEF2C0", "default": false, "description": "Small PRs", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}], "html_url": "https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/19269"}, "reviews": [], "review_comments": [], "issue_comments": [], "commits": [], "files": [], "timeline": [], "_partial": "search", "_source": "extra-data/github-search/author_frankvicky_is_pr.json"}